From cafb95c770ef6551e4ef9c13e8988cb5eb73c0cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nate Bohman <natrinicle@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 17 Sep 2025 11:30:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Fixes for Linux Kernel 6.16

Builds on 6.16.3 using both 239.patch and
ipt_netflow.2.6_kernel_6.4.patch from
https://aur.archlinux.org/packages/ipt_netflow
as well as two fixes for del_timer_sync() being renamed to
timer_delete_sync() as detailed in
https://www.mail-archive.com/debian-bugs-dist@lists.debian.org/msg2039396.html
---
 compat.h       | 109 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++---------------------
 configure      |   5 ++-
 dkms.conf      |   4 ++
 gen_compat_def |  71 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 ipt_NETFLOW.c  |  64 ++++++++++++++++++-----------
 5 files changed, 172 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)

